#      (a) Added "other structures" fallback in _pvp_cannon_rush_zealot_micro():
#          after cannons (priority 1) and pylons (priority 2), zealots now
#          target ANY enemy structure within 25 of ourmain or 15 of ournat
#          (assimilators, gateways, forges, etc.). This handles gas-blocking
#          assimilators and any other proxy cheese near our base.
#      (b) Added enemy structure targeting in manage_army_movement BASE DEFENSE:
#          when no enemy units are near our base but enemy structures exist
#          within 25 of ourmain / 15 of ournat, free zealots (not plug/backup)
#          attack the closest enemy structure. This covers non-cannon-rush
#          scenarios where the enemy builds on our gas.
