#      (cyber core). This caused the HP replacement code to send replacement
#      probes to the nexus position instead of the cyber core position when
#      the builder got stuck or took damage. The replacement probe had to
#      travel from far away, causing significant build delays.
#      FIX: Clear builder_current_task and builder_task_target immediately
