#  90. PVT PROXY HIDDEN TECH: MAIN PYLON POSITION + STATE MACHINE INFINITE LOOP:
#      THREE BUGS causing the main pylon to never be built in PvT proxy
#      hidden tech games:
#      (a) INFINITE STATE LOOP (4→2→3→4): After gas 2 is confirmed,
#          state 3.5 transitions to state 4 (cyber core). But cyber is
#          already built (proxy hidden tech builds cyber BEFORE gas).
#          State 4 sees cyber exists → goes to state 2 (gas). State 2
#          sees gas 1 exists → state 3. State 3 sees gas 2 exists →
#          state 4. Loop forever. The main pylon (state 5) is never
#          reached. FIX: State 3.5 now transitions directly to state 5
#          (main pylon) for proxy hidden tech, bypassing state 4.
#          Additionally, state 4 has a safety check: if cyber exists AND
#          both gases are done, go to state 5 instead of state 2.
#      (b) WRONG MAIN PYLON POSITION (pre-move): States 2.5, 3, 3.5, 4
#          pre-moved the builder probe to `ourmain.towards(ournat, 6.0)`
#          instead of the standard `ourmain.towards(map_center, 10)` used
#          by ALL other builds (reaper response, PvZ hatch-first, PvP,
#          transition). This put the probe at a different location than
#          where the pylon would actually be built, wasting pre-move time.
#          FIX: All pre-moves now use `ourmain.towards(map_center, 10)`
#          (snapped to integer grid), consistent with every other build.
#      (c) WRONG MAIN PYLON POSITION (actual build): State 5 built the
#          pylon at `ourmain.towards(enemymain, 8.0)` or
#          `ourmain.towards(ournat, 8.0)` instead of the standard
#          `ourmain.towards(map_center, 10)`. This is a DIFFERENT position
#          than what all other builds use, causing inconsistency in
#          pylon placement across matchups. FIX: State 5 now uses
#          `ourmain.towards(map_center, 10)` as the primary position
#          (with fallbacks to 8 and 6 distance), same as reaper response,
#          PvZ hatch-first, PvP, and transition builds.
