#      minerals after fighting an SCV at gw1. FIX: Added _mineral_near_nearest_nexus()
#      helper that finds the nearest ready nexus to the worker, then returns
#      a mineral field near that nexus. Falls back to ourmain minerals, then
#      to closest-to-worker. This ensures workers always mine near a nexus
#      that can accept their resources. Applied to all 9 locations in
#      manage_builder_probe_defense (helper release, HP replacement, stuck)
#      and _worker_retaliation (leash break, gas worker release).
