# =========================================================================
#  151. PVZ HATCH-FIRST: ADEPTS x4 THEN STALKERS BEFORE CHARGE:
#      The _hatch_first_active section in manage_army_production was
#      producing stalkers after 2 adepts (Step 2), but the correct unit
#      order for hatch-first (no lings) is:
