#      _pvt_detect_air_threat() in the 4-GATE path, starport+techlab is
#      never detected and the robo for observers is never built. Cloaked
#      banshees arrive and kill everything with zero detection response.
#      FIX: Call _pvt_detect_air_threat() and manage_pvt_air_pivot() in
#      the 4-GATE path before execute_four_gate_allin().
#
#  DEV NOTE #213: 4-GATE → REAPER TRANSITION. When the 4-gate path
#      detects air threat and builds robo + observer, we float minerals
#      because we only have 2 gateways and no forge/twilight/charge.
