#      the 4-gate state machine (set four_gate_state=0) and into the
#      reaper response at state 8 (forge). The reaper chain handles:
#      forge → twilight → +1 armor → charge → warpgate → done.
#      After reaper state 13, flower production builds extra gateways
#      up to 7 for the chargelot timing attack. Also clears
