#  225. PVT FORGE_FIRST: TWILIGHT COUNCIL NEVER BUILT AFTER FORGE:
#      PROBLEM: When the bot goes forge_first (1-base opponent, proxy rax
#      detected), the _pvt_proxy_rax flag permanently blocked twilight
#      council construction in manage_production_buildings(). The only
#      path to build twilight was the forge_first production code in
#      manage_army_production(), which had fragile placement requirements
#      (only searched pylons near ournat; if none existed within 15,
#      twilight was NEVER built — no fallback). Without twilight:
#      no charge research, no blink, no timing attack. The bot floats
#      6000+ minerals with idle gateways and 0 production. Two root causes:
